{"name":"Spell Caster","hex":"#4a373e","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"spell","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Words or a formula supposed to have magical powers. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","A magical effect or influence induced by an incantation or formula."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To put under the influence of a spell; to affect by a spell; to bewitch; to fascinate; to charm.","To hanker or yearn (for something)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/spell"},{"term":"caster","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Someone or something that casts.","A wheeled assembly attached to a larger object at its base to facilitate rolling. A caster usually consists of a wheel (which may be plastic, a hard elastomer, or metal), an axle, a mounting provision (usually a stem, flange, or plate), and sometimes a swivel (which allows the caster to rotate for steering)."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To act as a caster (wheeled assembly)."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/caster"}],"entries":[{"title":"Caster","blocks":[{"text":"A caster is an undriven wheel that is designed to be attached to the bottom of a larger object to enable that object to be moved."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/08/Swivel_caster.jpg/330px-Swivel_caster.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Caster","wikidata":"Q1534874"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/L%C3%B6ffelholz-Codex_Ms-Berol-Germ-Qu-132_Fol_010v.png/500px-L%C3%B6ffelholz-Codex_Ms-Berol-Germ-Qu-132_Fol_010v.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/L%C3%B6ffelholz-Codex_Ms-Berol-Germ-Qu-132_Fol_010v.png/1280px-L%C3%B6ffelholz-Codex_Ms-Berol-Germ-Qu-132_Fol_010v.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f6/L%C3%B6ffelholz-Codex_Ms-Berol-Germ-Qu-132_Fol_010v.png/500px-L%C3%B6ffelholz-Codex_Ms-Berol-Germ-Qu-132_Fol_010v.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Drawing of a swivelling caster from Codex Löffelholz, Nuremberg 1505","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AL%C3%B6ffelholz-Codex_Ms-Berol-Germ-Qu-132_Fol_010v.png"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Caster-wheels-chair.jpg/500px-Caster-wheels-chair.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ef/Caster-wheels-chair.jpg/500px-Caster-wheels-chair.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Two wheeled swivel casters on a desk chair (no fork)","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACaster-wheels-chair.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Subwoofer_driver_and_enclosure.jpg/500px-Subwoofer_driver_and_enclosure.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Subwoofer_driver_and_enclosure.jpg/1280px-Subwoofer_driver_and_enclosure.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2b/Subwoofer_driver_and_enclosure.jpg/500px-Subwoofer_driver_and_enclosure.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Four heavy duty casters on a large subwoofer whose weight can exceed 500 pounds (230 kg) depending on driver and top loading, and must be able to withstand rough handling.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASubwoofer_driver_and_enclosure.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/70/Swivel_caster_with_wheel_lock.JPG/500px-Swivel_ca